{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"Atiyah–Hirzebruch谱序列"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“Atiyah–Hirzebruch 谱序列”"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Atiyah–Hirzebruch 谱序列是 "},{"Local":{"url":"Serre谱序列","text":"Serre 谱序列"}},{"Plain":"的推广. 对于"},{"Local":{"url":"纤维列","text":"纤维列"}},{"Plain":" $F \\to P \\to X$ 以及广义上同调理论 $E$ 有谱序列\n$$\r\nH^*(X,E^*(F)) \\Rightarrow E^*(P).\r\n$$\n一个常用的特例是, 当 $F=\\mathrm {pt}$ 时, 该谱序列化为\n$$\r\nH^*(X,E^*)\\Rightarrow E^*(X),\r\n$$\n即用 $E^*(\\mathrm {pt})$-系数普通上同调计算 $E$ 表示的广义上同调.</p>\n"}]}}